The dataset combines AHODO-authored structure with source-derived information. This notice does not grant rights in third-party metadata or facts. Follow the resource-specific status, licence, attribution information and evidence recorded in each item and the public source manifest. Where a source metadata licence is `not_established`, AHODO grants no licence on the source institution's behalf.

