AHODO permits access to, downloading, reading and use of AHODO-authored public materials in this current repository for personal, educational and non-commercial research purposes. This permission does not override source licences, attribution obligations, community-governance information or rights in underlying works. Quotation and other uses allowed by applicable law remain unaffected.

