## 7. No additional rights granted

No permission, endorsement, cultural authority or clearance for AI training is implied beyond the rights expressly described here and in the resource-level evidence. This notice concerns the current and future versions of this curated public repository to the extent legally possible; it does not purport to withdraw permissions granted under earlier repository versions.
